cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "KKT segmentation validity: automatic verb-bounded units vs. UD gold clauses (Uzbek)"
abstract: >-
  Data and scripts comparing the automatic verb-bounded units of the KKT analysis pipeline (rule V0) with the gold
  clauses of the Uzbek Universal Dependencies treebanks UD_Uzbek-UT and UD_Uzbek-UzUDT (1 182 sentences): boundary
  precision and recall for a broad and a narrow gold definition, and the Heaps-type exponent of the clause-pattern
  inventory for V0 units, gold clauses on system tags and gold clauses on gold tags.
